---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy · Rajvardhan Singh Badgujar"
  description="Privacy policy and data handling practices for Rajvardhan Singh Badgujar's portfolio and professional cloud services."
  canonicalUrl="/privacy"
>
  <div class="pt-24 pb-16 md:pt-32 md:pb-20 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="bg-white border-2 border-black p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-neo">
      <div class="inline-block bg-neo-muted border-2 border-black px-3 py-1 shadow-neo-sm rotate-1 mb-4">
        <span class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs">Legal</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-black mb-6">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>

      <div class="prose max-w-none text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-800 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
        <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> May 2026</p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase border-b-2 border-black pb-1 pt-4 text-black">1. Overview</h2>
        <p>
          This website (<strong>rajvardhansingh.in</strong>) is the personal professional portfolio of Rajvardhan Singh Badgujar. I respect your privacy and am committed to protecting any personal information submitted via this site.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase border-b-2 border-black pb-1 pt-4 text-black">2. Information Collection</h2>
        <p>
          When you submit the contact form, you provide your name, email address, topic, and message content. This information is submitted securely via <strong>Web3Forms</strong> and is used solely to respond to your inquiries regarding employment, consulting, or technical collaborations.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase border-b-2 border-black pb-1 pt-4 text-black">3. Analytics & Telemetry</h2>
        <p>
          This website may use privacy-preserving, cookie-less analytics (such as Cloudflare Web Analytics) to monitor aggregate traffic, bandwidth, and site health. No personally identifiable tracking cookies are stored on your device.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase border-b-2 border-black pb-1 pt-4 text-black">4. Data Sharing & Retention</h2>
        <p>
          Your contact information is never sold, leased, or distributed to third parties. Inquiry correspondence is retained only as long as necessary for professional communication.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-base font-black uppercase border-b-2 border-black pb-1 pt-4 text-black">5. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For privacy questions or data deletion requests, contact Rajvardhan directly at <strong>rajvardhancoder@gmail.com</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200">
        <a href="/" class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-black hover:text-neo-accent">
          ← Back to Portfolio
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
